<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2448] Minor focus transfer issue while navigating through paragraphs with keyboard</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2448</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Suppose we have three paragraphs Para-A, Para-B, Para-C. In A and B, the editor is hidden&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When I use down arrow to navigate between paragraphs(one&apos;s with editors hidden)&lt;br/&gt;
It jumps directly from Para-A to Para-C&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;But, if I go up using keyboard up-arrow&lt;br/&gt;
The focus is transferred as Para-C -&amp;gt; Para-B -&amp;gt; Para-A&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please see the screenshots&lt;/p&gt;</description>
