&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2448&quot; title=&quot;Minor focus transfer issue while navigating through paragraphs with keyboard&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-2448&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-2448&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Fix paragraph navigation issue&lt;/p&gt;

