&lt;p&gt;    Fix paragraph navigation issue&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Keyboard events are broadcasted to components in lower tree&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Focus was getting transffered to the lower paragraphs, cauing a chaining effect&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Making emit synchronous fixes the problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


